  "about": "Classes: adventuring callings a member of an ancestry can take, with Orsino's chassis. hitDie and attributes add to the rolled character (Orsino's classModifier overlay); abilities are known from creation (melee or ranged is added from the equipped weapon); weapons and armor are the starting tables; proficiencies bound what can be equipped; specializations are the trait choices (a mage school, a cleric domain, a warrior disposition), chosen at creation; spellcasting gives a caster's slots by level (a B/X-style table; one more first-level slot for a casting attribute of 14 or more); a class without it casts no levelled spells.",
